The bundled sample data is redistributed from public sources under their own
terms, and is not covered by the licence above:

  * Yersinia pestis plasmid pPCP1 (NC_005816) and HIV-1 capsid C-terminal
    domain (1A8O) — public domain records from NCBI RefSeq and the RCSB PDB,
    redistributed via the Biopython test suite.
  * Airway smooth muscle RNA-seq counts (GSE52778) — public GEO submission;
    Himes et al. (2014) PLoS ONE 9(6):e99625. Counts as distributed with the
    Bioconductor 'airway' package.
  * Escherichia coli core and iJO1366 metabolic models — distributed with
    COBRApy; Orth et al. (2010) EcoSal Plus and Orth et al. (2011) Mol Syst
    Biol 7:535.

Cite the original sources, not BioIDE, for any work derived from them.
